{"id":"alcalde","lemma":"alcalde","pos":"noun","rank":1233,"glosses":["mayor (the leader of a city or a municipality)","an official such as an administrator, mayor, or judge","A variation of brisca for three players, that is played with the forty-card pack of Spanish-suited playing cards."],"ipa":"/alˈkalde/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"alcaldes","feminine":"alcaldesa","femininePlural":"alcaldesas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-alcalde.wav","formAudio":{"alcaldesa":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-alcaldesa.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Yo competí para alcalde.","en":"I ran for mayor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441810"},{"text":"¿Quién es la alcaldesa?","en":"Who's the mayor?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/915750"},{"text":"¿Eres tú el alcalde?","en":"Are you the mayor?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443593"},{"text":"Él fue reelegido alcalde.","en":"He was re-elected mayor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461661"},{"text":"Deberías presentarte para alcalde.","en":"You should run for mayor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803618"}]}